## RECOMMENDATION
**Add to 18%**

Per the decision matrix: No stumble + Strengthening thesis → Add. This is not converted to Hold. Near-term gross margin lumpiness and ATM dilution are position-sizing inputs (reflected in the 18% target rather than the 50% cap), not reasons to defer the Add action.

